# Agent Skills

This project keeps a small set of skills from [skills.sh](https://www.skills.sh/) in `.cursor/skills/`:

| Skill | When to use |
|---|---|
| `tailwind-design-system` | Tailwind v4 `@theme`, tokens, variants, dark mode |
| `shadcn` | Adding or customizing shadcn/ui components |
| `git-workflow` | Commits, branches, PRs (Conventional Commits format) |

React, TypeScript, and project conventions are covered by `.cursor/rules/` and `AGENTS.md` — do not install additional skills without asking.

Install or update: `npx skills add <owner/repo> --skill <name> --agent cursor --copy -y`

After installing to `.agents/skills/`, copy into `.cursor/skills/`. Keep total skills lean (≤3 packages).
